  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>This function must be executed from a script in an object owned by the region owner or an estate manager.</li>
    <li>This function is throttled at 4 calls every 2 minutes.</li>
    <li>Always returns 0</li>
    <li>PBR terrain is all or nothing. Mixing normal terrain textures with PBR textures will cause the PBR textures to appear gray.</li>
  </ul>
